<section class="wrap stage" id="history">
  <div class="stage-rail"><div class="stage-num">←</div><span class="mono">the record</span></div>
  <div class="stage-body">
    <h2>Three thousand years of <i>the same</i> physics</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Most of the colors above were found by glassmakers long before anyone could explain them. Each pin on this rail is colored by the same engine as the stages, so an Egyptian bead, a Roman cup and a 1939 light filter are computed from their spectra, not taken from photographs. Pick one to see what happened and which stage explains it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hist">
      <ol class="hist-rail" aria-label="history of glass color, oldest first">
        {TICKS.map(([y, lab], i) => <li class={`hist-tick${i === 0 ? ' first' : i === TICKS.length - 1 ? ' last' : ''}`} aria-hidden="true" style={`--x:${at(y)}%`}><span>{lab}</span></li>)}
        {pins.filter((p) => p.x1 != null).map((p) => <li class="hist-span" aria-hidden="true" data-pin={p.id} style={`--x:${p.x}%;--x1:${p.x1}%`}></li>)}
        {pins.map((p) => (
          <li class="pin" data-lane={p.lane} data-side={p.right ? 'right' : 'left'} style={`--x:${p.x}%`}>
            <button type="button" data-id={p.id} aria-controls={`hist-${p.id}`} aria-pressed="false">
              <i class={`bead${p.color ? '' : ' hollow'}`} data-pin={p.id}></i>
              <span class="pin-lab"><span class="pin-when">{p.when}</span><b>{p.short}</b></span>
            </button>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
      <div class="hist-cards" aria-live="polite">
        {pins.map((p) => (
          <article class="hist-card" id={`hist-${p.id}`} data-id={p.id}>
            <i class={`bead${p.color ? '' : ' hollow'}`} data-pin={p.id}></i>
            <div>
              <span class="mono">{p.when}</span>
              <h3>{p.title}</h3>
              <p>{p.text}</p>
              <p class="more">
                {p.stage ? <a href={`#${p.stage}`}>See it in stage {STAGES[p.stage]} →</a> : <span>Not on this page yet</span>}
                {p.sources.map(([label, url]) => <a class="src" href={url} rel="noopener">{label} ↗</a>)}
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="aside"><b>Broken scale.</b> The rail is linear within each span between its labeled years, and the spans are stretched so the last two centuries get room: the 3,000 years before 1000 CE take its first quarter. Dates were checked against the sources linked in each card in October 2026; where a source is weak the card says so.</p>
  </div>
</section>

